   "en": "Atashi wa Seikan Kokka no Eiyuu Kishi"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "I Am the Heroic Knight of the Interstellar Nation"
   },
   {
    "ja": "あたしは星間国家の英雄騎士！"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I won't stop. Until the day I become a knight of justice. The interstellar nation of the Algrand Empire - its frontier territory of Banfield. A young girl named Emma admires the lord who saved her when she was young, and after working hard, she finally takes her first steps as a \"knight\". \"I will... be a knight of justice!\" However, after making a huge mistake in her first battle, she is deemed incompetent and ordered to be demoted to the frontier planet Aerias. Feeling powerless, Emma is about to give up on being a knight when the mobile knight who once saved her from a difficult situation appears before her――!? The heroic tale of a dropout girl knight who rises to the top of a new \"interstellar nation\" in pursuit of her dream begins!"
  },
